repair = "Use explicit monorepo-root-relative paths for registered SQL, source_inputs and legacy source files; preserve verified SQL digests and all source provenance digests."
closure_boundary = "Every registered SQL and legacy source resolves. Missing retired handoff provenance and changed owning-domain sources remain explicit wiring requests with approval withheld. Current coordinatortest already accepts monorepo paths and verifies file digests; removing its old-prefix compatibility and executing runtime-role bootstrap are out of scope."

